                "organization": "Start Reverse",
                "biography": "Andre is keynote speaker and Strategy Consultant, working with senior business leaders on Reverse Leadership, Cultural Transformation, Award-winning Customer Experience, as well as Transformational Learning.\n\nHe is the founder of Start Reverse, a boutique consultancy with projects in the region and around the globe. The Reverse philosophy has impacted many leading hotel brands and the (work) lives of hundreds of thousands of leaders and professionals in Hospitality and beyond.\n\nAndre is the heart and mind behind this disruptive approach, boosting relevance, engagement and loyalty. He is also the author of the ‘START REVERSE’ books (The Novel and The Journey).",
