                "lastName": "Krüger",
                "photoUrl": "https://static.swapcard.com/public/images/52a0e4c54d73424eba2ec8fac78f2619.jpeg",
                "organization": "Pandox AB",
                "biography": "Jan-Patrick Krüger is a seasoned executive in the hospitality and real estate sector, currently the Managing Director for Pandox AB in Germany and Austria. With decades of experience, he specializes in operational excellence, profit improvement, and asset management. His strategic insights have driven successful project and change management initiatives, significantly enhancing guest experiences and organizational performance. A graduate of Cornell University’s and Singapore’s Business School Advanced Management Program, Jan-Patrick has overseen a diverse portfolio of over 40 property and operational companies and is recognized for his exceptional ability to foster owner relations and effectively serve as an owner’s representative, ensuring alignment of interests and maximizing value. His approach combines insightful communication with a deep understanding of ownership dynamics, leading to successful partnerships and sustainable growth.",
