                "organization": "Bloomberg",
                "biography": "Yousef Gamal El-Din is the founder of Stagespring. He hosts high-profile figures including heads-of-state, ministers, CEOs and billionaires. Notably, his interview with the SNB Chairman in 2023 shook up the financial world, leading to the sale of Credit Suisse.\n\nIn over 15 years of live TV, he has secured exclusive conversations with many celebrated leaders, among them Christine Lagarde. Some 1,500 top decision-makers have joined him so far. He speaks regularly at the Future Investment Initiative and other key global events.\n\nGamal El-Din's journey covers eight years as an anchor with Bloomberg Television and previously at CNBC. The shows looked at the most important business and economic issues shaping markets.",
