                "photoUrl": "https://static.swapcard.com/public/images/fe82653e3724419b8b5e7ba32b3f3066.jpeg",
                "organization": "UN Tourism",
                "biography": "Senior Innovation Specialist at the United Nations World Tourism Organization, leading innovative programs and strategic partnerships. Previously founder of Destination Arabia, a startup in Saudi Arabia, driving growth and tailored tourism experiences. Alsatti brings with him extensive experience in connecting tourism with technology and investment, focusing on sustainable solutions and impactful networking. Committed to enhancing global tourism through forward-thinking innovation.",
