                "jobTitle": "Co-Founder & CEO",
                "lastName": "Alidina",
                "photoUrl": "https://static.swapcard.com/public/images/1495f0f1b93c4bb38b00242a89aaf7bc.jpeg",
                "organization": "Inntelo AI",
                "biography": "Asif Alidina is the Co-Founder and CEO of Inntelo AI, a conversational and agentic AI platform for hospitality and real estate. Inntelo made history in 2025 by launching the UK’s first AI Concierge, introducing AI-powered communications into daily guest interactions and hotel operations. Backed by Antler, Haatch, Look AI Ventures, and the British Business Bank, the company is live across Europe and the Middle East and was named winner of the FHS Riyadh Startup Den Award 2025. Asif is leading AI adoption in hospitality, helping hotels drive efficiencies, unlock new revenue, and deliver personalisation at scale through agentic AI that can act, reason, and plan in real time.",
