                "jobTitle": "Founder & CEO",
                "lastName": "Sammoura",
                "photoUrl": "https://static.swapcard.com/public/images/af9f243701714499b2a0d7fd38b52204.jpeg",
                "organization": "Meyraki",
                "biography": "Israa Sammoura is a visionary architect and entrepreneur who founded Meyraki in 2020, transforming it into one of the region’s fastest-growing spatial design firms. Under her leadership, Meyraki has delivered over 40 projects across Saudi Arabia, Egypt, and Lebanon, Georgia and Tanzania .\nworking with government entities, luxury developers, and boutique brands.\n\nHolding a Bachelor’s degree in Architectural Engineering from Lebanon and a Master’s in Interior and Living Design from Milan, Israa brings a rare blend of technical precision and creative innovation. Her work bridges aesthetics, functionality, and strategic value — reshaping how spaces are experienced and optimized.\nToday, through Meyraki Insight, she is bringing the next evolution of spatial intelligence, combining data, AI, and design to empower businesses, cities, and communities across the region.",
