                "organization": "Minor Hotel Group Limited",
                "biography": "Omar Romero is the Chief Development and Luxury Officer at Minor Hotels, a leading global hospitality group. In this newly created role, he drives the company's global development strategy, oversees project planning and execution, and cultivates key stakeholder relationships. He also plays a crucial role in shaping and supporting the curation of Minor Hotels' luxury brands, ensuring exceptional guest experiences.\n\nPrior to joining Minor Hotels, Romero served as Chief Development Officer at Six Senses, where he led the global development team for over half his tenure. He has spearheaded the signing of over 50 Hotel Management Agreements and multiple branded residence projects throughout his career. \n\nIn addition, Romero successfully navigated and contributed to strategic direction during three distinct ownership transitions involving Soneva Group, Pegasus Capital Advisors LP, and InterContinental Hotels Group. Romero holds a degree from the esteemed Ecole Hôtelière de Lausanne and Les Roches Hotel Management School. With over two decades of experience in the hospitality industry, he brings a wealth of knowledge and a global perspective to his role at Minor Hotels.",
