                "biography": "Jessy El Murr is a PWC certified corporate trainer and a former BBC & Forbes Middle East journalist with 18+ years of news writing, editing and presenting. She is the Founder of Motahadith, a MENA based flagship corporate training business. \n\nShe covered exclusive news stories from Washington D.C, Afghanistan, Beirut and Riyadh. She has passion for captivating storytelling, public speaking and a successful track record in digital tools. She founded Motahadith|a in 2022, a unique public speaking and media training business, helping C-level executives to increase their media impact and executive presence. Jessy is am a licensed public speaking coach by (EAHEA) and a senior media trainer working with top international consulting firms including PWC. She continues to deliver trainings to senior government officials and top brand executives in Riyadh, Jeddah, Abu Dhabi, Dubai, and Kuwait.",
