                "id": "U3BlYWtlcihFdmVudF8xOTkyMjcyLEV2ZW50UGVvcGxlXzM3NTUyMDUwLFVzZXJfMjA4MDcxNTUp",
                "jobTitle": "Partner - Head of Hospitality, Tourism & Leisure Advisory Services MENA",
                "lastName": "El Kadiri",
                "photoUrl": "https://static.swapcard.com/public/images/dc29cc55509a4976a69bfc9f6d8f860c.png",
                "organization": "Knight Frank",
                "biography": "Having an extensive experience in real estate & hospitality management across Europe and the Middle East and North Africa, Oussama benefits from unique experience having previously headed the hotel development activities in the Middle East for international operators such as Accor with a focus on the Premium, Midscale and Economy brands of the group, as well as Radisson Hotel Group with a focus on Saudi Arabia.\nHis real estate and hospitality consulting experience spans over a variety of geographies within the EMEA region. While being a hospitality specialist, Oussama has had exposure to most asset classes including hospitality, residential, retail, entertainment and MICE which are key in advising on the best-in-class mixed-use project. Oussama advised on the tourism & hospitality segment for many of the shaping projects in Saudi Arabia, including KAFD, NEOM, Al Ula, Al Soudah, Dirriyah Gate and many others.",
