                "jobTitle": "Founder & CEO",
                "lastName": "Kayal",
                "photoUrl": "https://static.swapcard.com/public/images/6a9f9d2752154c5393f4e3a56a69651c.jpeg",
                "organization": "Nabati",
                "biography": "As the founder of Nabati: A Conscious Eatery, this Saudi chef seamlessly integrates her passion for food and sustainability. Crafting a dining experience that is both innovative and mindful. Her entirely plant-based, gluten-free, and refined sugar-free menu embodies a commitment to zero waste and plastic-free principles, redefining ethical dining. She also pioneered a nutritious ice cream, demonstrating that indulgence and well-being can harmoniously coexist. Through Nabati, she transforms the way we engage with food by making sustainability not just a choice but a refined, accessible, and deeply satisfying way of life.",
