                "biography": "Heidi Grimwood’s journey in the wellness industry began at just 19 and has evolved into a remarkable career spanning over 25 years in spa and wellness operations and development. Celebrated as a forward-thinking luminary, Heidi is renowned for her innovative approach to conceptualizing and executing exceptional wellness programs.\n\nHer diverse experience includes pivotal roles such as Co-Director at FG Innovation Management Ltd, where she pioneered spa management in Ireland, and founding the inaugural corporate gym at Virgin Atlantic Airways HQ. Heidi’s expertise has been sought after at prestigious destinations including Inchydoney Lodge & Spa, Aghadoe Heights Hotel & Spa, aboard the QE2 Oceanliner during its world cruise, and at One and Only Reethi Rah in the Maldives, along with her contributions to Steiner Transocean – Worldwide’s global reach.\n\nAs a sought-after speaker, Heidi has shared her insights at international business and wellness summits, including key industry events focused on leadership, innovation, and sustainability. Her thought leadership continues to inspire professionals and shape the direction of global wellness trends.\n\nIn recognition of her dedication and pioneering contributions to the wellness field, Heidi was honored as Global Spa Leader of the Year at the World Spa and Wellness Awards 2022. Now, as Wellness Personality of the Year at the Hotelier Maldives Awards 2024, Heidi’s remarkable achievements and forward-thinking leadership continue to shape the future of wellness on a global scale.",
