                "biography": "Nicolas Nasra is the Head of Hotel Advisory for the MENA region at Colliers, based in Dubai. With extensive expertise in hospitality strategy, development consultancy, and financial feasibility across the UAE, Saudi Arabia, and Oman, he advises top-tier developers, sovereign entities, banks, and private offices. Nicolas is known for challenging the status quo, bringing a data-driven yet human-centric approach to tourism and real estate advisory. A Canadian professional with a passion for technology, philosophy, and high-end gastronomy, he combines analytical precision with creative insight to help shape the region’s most ambitious hospitality and destination projects.",
