                "biography": "Aseem Kapoor is Founder & Chief Executive of ARK People Solutions, a consultancy specializing in bringing brands to life through people. He leads a team of hospitality, talent and brand experience professionals who are passionate about creating impact to re-define success for those they work with.\n\nWith a diverse set of leadership experiences, Aseem specialises in crafting agile and innovative business-driven talent and culture functions. Under his leadership, ARK has rapidly grown by creating talent strategies covering all aspects of the people experience, including developing brand culture, and standards, and designing learning content. ARK also excels in crafting customer journey maps, enabling businesses to deliver a consistent brand experience across all touchpoints. ARK also manages mystery shopping, compliance audits and continuous improvement processes to ensure operational excellence.",
